			"member": "LogFunnelStepEvent",
			"part": "parameter",
			"parameter": "step",
			"before": "The step number in the funnel. This should be unique for each step in the funnel. All funnels start at step 1. Limited to steps 1-100. Note that if any steps are skipped, the intermediate steps will be considered completed.",
			"after": "The step number in the funnel. This should be unique for each step in the funnel. All funnels start at step 1. Limited to steps 1-100. Repeated steps by the same user in the same funnel session, or when <code>funnelSessionId</code> is <code>nil</code> will be ignored. Note that if any steps are skipped, the intermediate steps will be considered completed.",
			"value": {
				"MemberType": "Function",
